<title>USA: Yuma, Ariz., $9.5 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Yuma, Ariz., $9.5 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Principal Financial Securities Inc said Wednesday it repriced Yuma, Ariz.'s $9.5 million Municipal Property Corp subordinate lien excise tax revenue bonds, raising yields in several maturities and lifting the top yield in 2003 to 4.85 percent from 4.75 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>YUMA MUNICIPAL PROPERTY CORP</p>
<p>RE: $9,500,000</p>
<p>SUBORDINATE LIEN EXCISE TAX REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>DATED: SEPTEMBER 1, 1996</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: JANUARY 1, 1997</p>
<p>DUE: JULY 1</p>
<p>NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>DELIVERY: 9/12/1996</p>
<p>    7/1	     Amount	  Coupon	Price</p>
<p>    Maturity	(million)     (pct)	 (% of par)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    1997	    $1.195	  4.25	  NRO</p>
<p>    1998	    $1.250	  4.25	  100</p>
<p>    1999	    $1.305	  4.45	  100</p>
<p>    2000	    $1.365	  4.55	  100</p>
<p>    2001	    $1.425	  4.65	  100</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    2002	    $1.490	  4.75	  100</p>
<p>    2003	    $1.565	  4.85	  100</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
